Click-path signal status — readiness, last-computed, recent SignalEstimates

Usage: vendo measurement signals click-path [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --profile <name>    Use a specific account profile
      --sample-limit <n>  Number of recent SignalEstimates to fetch (1..500)
      --debug             Enable verbose request diagnostics
      --json              Output raw JSON
  -h, --help              Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo measurement signals click-path
  $ vendo measurement signals click-path --sample-limit 50 --json
